  "reflectionText": "Paul wrote to Philemon: I beg you for my child Onesimus, whom I have become the father of in my chains. Receive him no longer as a bondservant, but more than a bondservant — a beloved brother. What is it to be asked to receive back the one who wronged you, no longer as anything less than a brother in the Lord?"
}
